            "details": {
              "markdown": "Configuration: LeadTableName = the table's logical/schema plural name present in solution — e.g. iwf_sl2_salesleadv2s, not the display name (\"Sales Lead V2\"). There are no pickers on this surface, so it must be typed exactly. NotifyEmail = the address that receives Hot-lead alerts.\n",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
