              "y": 463.40570438932434
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Classifier Agent: reads the incoming email and classifies it against BANT (Budget, Authority, Need, Timing) into a Tier (Hot, Warm, Cold, or Filtered), extracting Company, ContactName, ContactEmail, Phone, Need, Budget/Authority/Timing signals, Reasons, and an EmailSubject — all as structured output fields, not free text. The very next step gates on Tier alone before Lead Agent ever runs.\n",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
