            "name": "Lead Agent",
            "type": "agent",
            "position": {
              "x": 1700.1281708830434,
              "y": 314.24090907541313
            },
            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "You are the Lead Agent for the Sales Lead Qualifier. You run immediately after the Classifier Agent. You have no tools — you only reason and produce structured output. Whether a Lead record actually gets created depends entirely on your ShouldLog decision below; a separate record-creation step reads your output directly and does nothing unless ShouldLog is true. Whether a notification email gets s"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-c021bb01-6b0f-42d3-b51f-238e51f42f60",
            "name": "Note 4",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1686.74161594294,
              "y": 460.378148002129
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Lead Agent: tool-less — only runs for genuine enquiries (Filtered is already handled upstream), reasoning over Classifier Agent's structured fields. Decides every field value for the Lead record (ShouldLog is always true here) plus ShouldNotify (true only when Tier is Hot) and the alert email's subject/body. Does not touch Dataverse or Outlook itself — the row-creation and notification steps read ",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-f62c7851-20fa-416c-808c-851135233750",
            "name": "Note 2",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 267.6078976063061,
              "y": 455.91996536263514
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Trigger: fires when a new email with 'sales' in the subject arrives in the shared mailbox. Each matching email is passed to the Classifier Agent to decide if it's a genuine sales enquiry and consumes one AI call. If you're only experimenting, turn the workflow off between test runs to avoid unnecessary credit consumption.\n",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-f6e04cfd-5f84-4964-9328-805233faf67d",
            "name": "Note 5",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 269.9794086504648,
              "y": 792.262211107231
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "If the Folder field shows \"Loading...\" after importing this solution, the folder ID is tied to the original mailbox. reopen the trigger and re-select the folder for your own mailbox connection before publishing or use clear to point to default Inbox.",
              "color": "blue"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ifElse-0bdc1a08-7eb8-40f6-86c0-dc0aa22975b4",
